title Home Assistant: a start without a connection: the layout of the last session (layout.json: the tabs, the names and icons), greyed, "..." until Home Assistant answers; Connecting... in the tab bar
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO connecting

wait 800
shot connecting
check connecting
expect text "Connecting..."
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect text "Bedroom"
expect text "..."
key pgdn
wait 600
shot connecting-area
check connecting-area
expect text "Bedside lamp"
expect noquit
